{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2021-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1631750400, "end_date": 1632355199, "month_true_total": 1624, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:45:11 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "99809277", "author": {"steamid": "76561198382479031", "personaname": "kay", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Kaypho/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 19647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 116, "playtime_at_review": 15336, "last_played": 1788939996, "avatar": "6a9680b0b469bb8286e0ea57af05b244dd2dec62"}, "language": "english", "review": "They released a patch to fix it, ignore all that follows. . .\nROR2 is one of my favorite games. I've put a few hundred hours in and I love it. But with the gearbox acquisition and the forced release of SOTS, I cannot right now recommend anyone to get into the game. \nUnifying the code-base to be based on the console version code is absolutely insane. \nThere are so many insane bugs that simply do not make sense. How does delta time not work. . . having higher FPS means physics sims run faster (this include loaders grapple, allowing you to go across the entire stage in a few seconds with 0 items when the games at higher frame rates).\nEnemy spawning is faster and higher fps. \nHow do items in intractables not have outlines??? how is that an issue that is not immediately noticed by a QA team? Why cant you sprint or jump while holding tab? \nA lot of these bugs were fixed by mods created the day after the release. \nThe DLC itself is actually pretty decent, the skins and new maps/survivors are so much fun. . . but the update to the base games code is so broken, its something sad to see come from ROR2 it feels like the acquisition of Hopoo removed all the individuality and passion of the development.", "timestamp_created": 1632348722, "timestamp_updated": 1726080130, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99807611", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329721617", "personaname": "Saifu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Saifu1/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 19024, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1303, "last_played": 1771448426, "avatar": "936f05b037ab8b3f6891cf42a076260ec179b16e"}, "language": "english", "review": "My friend showed me this game and I have been playing it for a few days now. It is a well balanced games with a wide variety of different play styles. I would recommend this game to another friend.", "timestamp_created": 1632345624, "timestamp_updated": 1632345624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99807500", "author": {"steamid": "76561198841862277", "personaname": "MrDarthTurtl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DarthTurtul203/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 967, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 858, "last_played": 1633230180, "avatar": "711105af69a3e1e9abc614688355900d9149a1b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game smells like feet and for me feet are a no go", "timestamp_created": 1632345400, "timestamp_updated": 1632345400, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.421052634716033936", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refu